notice, and its header enumerates every modification made.

    Upstream: https://github.com/huggingface/smolagents/blob/v1.25.0/src/smolagents/local_python_executor.py

Modifications (also listed in the file header):
  - Removed the smolagents `Tool` import and the `send_tools` method; static tools
    are wired directly in `__init__`.
  - Inlined `BASE_BUILTIN_MODULES` and `truncate_content` from `smolagents.utils`
    so the file has no smolagents imports.
  - Upgraded `BreakException` / `ContinueException` / `ReturnException` from
    `Exception` to `BaseException`, so agent-emitted `try/except` cannot swallow
    control flow (upstream already does this for `FinalAnswerException`).
  - Repackaged from `smolagents` into `r3con.runtime`.

The behaviour of `evaluate_python_code`, the AST walker, the authorized-imports
allowlist, the dunder/operation/while/timeout limits, and `BASE_PYTHON_TOOLS` is
unchanged from upstream.

